han expected. @admin1 - Can due date be extended to October 15th?"}', '2026-08-16 15:17:54.732204'), (50, 21, 9, 'COMMENT', '{"text":"Ok - Changing due date to October 15th."}', '2026-08-16 15:18:46.960672'), (51, 21, 9, 'UPDATE', '{"new_value":"2026-10-15","field_changed":"due_date"}', '2026-08-16 15:18:56.818423'), (53, 27, 9, 'CREATION', '{"assignee":"user1","due_date":"2026-09-01","task_name":"Task 1"}', '2026-08-16 15:20:11.00577'), (54, 28, 9, 'CREATION', '{"due_date":"2026-08-28","task_name":"Task 2"}', '2026-08-16 15:20:36.881376'), (55, 28, 9, 'UPDATE', '{"new_value":"user2","field_changed":"assignee"}', '2026-08-16 15:20:45.751591'), (56, 29, 9, 'CREATION', '{"assignee":"user1","due_date":"2026-09-30","task_name":"Task 3"}', '2026-08-16 15:21:05.483875'), (57, 27, 6, 'UPDATE', '{"new_value":"In Progress","old_value":"To Do","field_changed":"status"}', '2026-08-16 15:21:40.096903'), (59, 28, 9, 'UPDATE', '{"new_value":"demo_user","field_changed":"assignee"}', '2026-08-17 10:12:12.185629');